        "ACHIEVEMENT_ENFORCER_DOOMUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_DESCRIPTION": "집행자로 한 번에 임프 20명을 처치하십시오.",
        "ACHIEVEMENT_ENFORCER_RIFLEUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_NAME": "Enforcer: Rapidfire",
